{"seq":2,"slug":"endogeneity-and-instrumental-variables","title":"内生性与工具变量（2SLS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/assumption-violations/endogeneity-and-instrumental-variables","wordCount":2109,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"内生性与工具变量-2sls\">内生性与工具变量（2SLS）</h1><p>OLS 一致性的全部赌注押在一个条件上：解释变量与扰动项不相关，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[X&#x27;\\varepsilon]=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。一旦这个条件破裂，回归系数就不再估计因果效应，而是把因果信号和「污染」混在一起。教育回报研究是经典例子——把工资对受教育年限做回归，估出来的系数同时装着「多读书涨工资」和「更聪明、家庭更好的人既读更多书也赚更多钱」这两股力量，后者就是内生性。工具变量（IV）与其最常用的实现两阶段最小二乘（2SLS）正是为剥离这种污染而生的方法，但 2026 年的应用计量已经把它从「F&gt;10 就放心」的粗放年代推进到对弱识别极度警惕的精细阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-内生性从何而来\">核心概念：内生性从何而来</h2><p>内生性指 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\varepsilon \\mid X]\\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 或更弱的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cov}(X,\\varepsilon)\\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。它不是单一缺陷，而是三类结构问题的统称，三者诊断思路和补救手段各异（其中测量误差导致的衰减偏误、可靠性比与非经典误差下 IV 反而放大偏误的风险，详见 <a href=\"multicollinearity-and-measurement-error\">多重共线性与测量误差</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[内生性&lt;br/&gt;Cov X,ε ≠ 0] --&gt; B[遗漏变量偏误&lt;br/&gt;omitted variable]&#10;  A --&gt; C[联立/反向因果&lt;br/&gt;simultaneity]&#10;  A --&gt; D[测量误差&lt;br/&gt;measurement error]&#10;  B --&gt; E[能力影响教育与工资]&#10;  C --&gt; F[价格与需求互相决定]&#10;  D --&gt; G[自报收入含噪声]&#10;  E --&gt; H[寻找工具变量 Z]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[2SLS / LIML / GMM]\">flowchart TD\n  A[内生性&lt;br/&gt;Cov X,ε ≠ 0] --&gt; B[遗漏变量偏误&lt;br/&gt;omitted variable]\n  A --&gt; C[联立/反向因果&lt;br/&gt;simultaneity]\n  A --&gt; D[测量误差&lt;br/&gt;measurement error]\n  B --&gt; E[能力影响教育与工资]\n  C --&gt; F[价格与需求互相决定]\n  D --&gt; G[自报收入含噪声]\n  E --&gt; H[寻找工具变量 Z]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[2SLS / LIML / GMM]</pre><p>工具变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 必须同时满足两条核心要求，缺一不可：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>数学表述</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可否检验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相关性（relevance）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cov}(Z,X)\\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>工具能预测内生变量</td>\n<td>可检验（第一阶段 F）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外生性（exogeneity）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cov}(Z,\\varepsilon)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>工具只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>恰好识别时不可检验，需论证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排他性（exclusion）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 不直接进入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 方程</td>\n<td>排除其他通道</td>\n<td>不可检验，靠制度知识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>相关性可以用数据检验，但外生性与排他性在恰好识别（工具数=内生变量数）下根本无法用数据验证——它们只能靠制度背景、自然实验设计和逻辑论证来辩护。这是 IV 方法最脆弱也最被审稿人盯防的环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2sls-的机制-两次回归拆解相关性\">2SLS 的机制：两次回归拆解相关性</h2><p>2SLS 的名字直白地描述了它的算法。设结构方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y=\\beta X+\\gamma W+\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 内生、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为外生控制变量，工具为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>第一阶段：把内生变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 对全部外生变量（工具 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 加控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>）回归，得到拟合值</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>Z</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}=\\hat{\\pi}_0+\\hat{\\pi}_1 Z+\\hat{\\pi}_2 W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一步的本质是从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 里「萃取」出只由外生工具驱动的那部分变异 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 渐近无关。</p>\n<p>第二阶段：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 回归，得到 2SLS 估计量</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_{2SLS}=\\frac{\\text{Cov}(\\hat{X},Y)}{\\text{Var}(\\hat{X})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7105em;vertical-align:-1.0868em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6238em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1632em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0868em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只保留了「干净」的外生波动，用它解释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 的变化，就只捕捉因果通道。当工具恰好识别时，2SLS 等价于简单 IV 估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_{IV}=\\text{Cov}(Z,Y)/\\text{Cov}(Z,X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>一个常见的实操陷阱：手动跑两次 OLS 会得到正确的点估计，但第二阶段的标准误是错的，因为它没有考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是估计值带来的额外不确定性。必须使用专门命令——Stata 的 <code>ivregress 2sls</code>、R 的 <code>AER::ivreg</code> 或 <code>fixest::feols</code>、Python 的 <code>linearmodels.IV2SLS</code>——它们会自动修正标准误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弱工具问题-f-10-已经不够用\">弱工具问题：F&gt;10 已经不够用</h2><p>2SLS 最危险的失效模式不是无解，而是悄悄给出有偏且过度自信的结果。当工具与内生变量相关性很弱（第一阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0），2SLS 会朝 OLS 的方向严重偏倚，且常规 t 检验的拒绝率远超名义 5%。</p>\n<p>长期流行的经验法则来自 Stock 与 Watson：第一阶段 F 统计量超过 10 就不必担心弱工具。但这条规则在 2026 年已被认为远远不够。Lee、McCrary、Moreira 与 Porter（2022，发表于 <em>American Economic Review</em>）证明：要保证常规双尾 2SLS t 检验的真实拒绝率不超过名义 5%，第一阶段 F 需高达 <strong>104.7</strong>，而非 10（<a href=\"https://www.aeaweb.org/articles?id=10.1257/aer.20181796\">Lee et al. 2022, AER</a>；综述见 <a href=\"http://research.economics.unsw.edu.au/RePEc/papers/2022-07b.pdf\">UNSW 工作论文 2022-07b</a>）。他们提出的 tF 方法把 t 检验的临界值表对第一阶段 F 取条件，从而在工具偏弱时自动放大置信区间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[拿到第一阶段 F] --&gt; B{F 大小?}&#10;  B --&gt;|F ≥ 104.7| C[常规 2SLS t 检验可靠]&#10;  B --&gt;|10 ≤ F &lt; 104.7| D[用 tF 调整临界值&lt;br/&gt;或弱工具稳健推断]&#10;  B --&gt;|F &lt; 10| E[工具弱&lt;br/&gt;切换 Anderson-Rubin]&#10;  C --&gt; F[报告点估计+常规CI]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[报告 AR 置信区间&lt;br/&gt;可能无界]\">flowchart TD\n  A[拿到第一阶段 F] --&gt; B{F 大小?}\n  B --&gt;|F ≥ 104.7| C[常规 2SLS t 检验可靠]\n  B --&gt;|10 ≤ F &lt; 104.7| D[用 tF 调整临界值&lt;br/&gt;或弱工具稳健推断]\n  B --&gt;|F &lt; 10| E[工具弱&lt;br/&gt;切换 Anderson-Rubin]\n  C --&gt; F[报告点估计+常规CI]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[报告 AR 置信区间&lt;br/&gt;可能无界]</pre><p>现代实践推荐的做法是改用对弱识别稳健的推断方法，它们无论工具强弱都保持正确覆盖率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Anderson-Rubin（AR）检验</strong>（Anderson 1949/1951）：通过检验反演构造置信区间，覆盖率不依赖工具强度，代价是当工具极弱时区间可能无界——但无界恰恰诚实地反映了「数据无法识别参数」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.12474\">arXiv 2508.12474，2025 弱工具稳健推断 Python 指南</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>条件似然比（CLR）检验</strong>（Moreira 2003）：在单内生变量时功效接近最优。</li>\n<li><strong>Kleibergen 的 LM/拉格朗日乘子检验</strong>（2002）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2025 年 <em>Review of Economic Studies</em> 的一篇文章进一步把 Stock-Yogo 弱工具检验推广到对异方差、自相关稳健，并扩展到多个内生变量的情形（<a href=\"https://academic.oup.com/restud/advance-article/doi/10.1093/restud/rdaf103/8407128\">Oxford Academic, RESTUD rdaf103</a>），说明弱工具诊断仍是活跃的研究前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"late-解读-异质性下-2sls-估计的到底是什么\">LATE 解读：异质性下 2SLS 估计的到底是什么</h2><p>即使工具完美外生且足够强，2SLS 估出的也未必是「平均处理效应」。当处理效应在个体间异质时，Imbens 与 Angrist 的局部平均处理效应（LATE）定理指出：在单调性假设（工具只朝一个方向推动每个人）下，2SLS 识别的是<strong>顺从者</strong>（compliers，即被工具从不处理推向处理的那群人）的平均效应，而非全体人群的效应。</p>\n<p>这意味着不同工具会估出不同的 LATE，因为它们撬动的是不同的顺从者子群。Mogstad 与 Torgovitsky（2024，<a href=\"https://www.nber.org/papers/w32927\">NBER w32927</a>；<a href=\"https://bfi.uchicago.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/BFI_WP_2024-113.pdf\">BFI 工作论文</a>）系统梳理了允许处理效应异质性的现代 IV 文献，指出两条路线：一是继续用线性 IV 并事后「反向工程」出 LATE 解读；二是「正向工程」显式建模异质性，以边际处理效应（MTE）框架为代表。他们警告：线性 IV 在多工具或带协变量时可能给某些子群分配<strong>负权重</strong>，使「弱因果」的估计在政策上失去意义。2026 年初还有研究探讨如何<strong>证伪</strong>异质处理效应下的 IV 模型（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.14464\">arXiv 2601.14464</a>），表明 LATE 解读本身也需要可检验的约束来支撑。</p>\n<p>实务结论：报告 2SLS 系数时必须明确说明它代表哪个人群、由哪个工具的边际变动驱动，不能含糊地称之为「这个政策的效果」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过度识别与诊断检验清单\">过度识别与诊断检验清单</h2><p>当工具数多于内生变量数（过度识别），就有了额外信息可以部分检验外生性。Sargan-Hansen 的过度识别检验（overidentification test，Hansen J 统计量）在「所有工具都外生」的原假设下，检验工具是否给出一致的估计。但要警惕：J 检验不拒绝原假设不等于工具一定外生，它只检验工具之间是否互相矛盾；若所有工具都同向违反外生性，检验会一致通过却全错。</p>\n<p>一份 2026 年可执行的 2SLS 报告至少应包含下列诊断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诊断</th>\n<th>命令示例（Stata / Python）</th>\n<th>判读标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一阶段 F</td>\n<td><code>estat firststage</code> / <code>iv.first_stage</code></td>\n<td>对照 tF 表，理想 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>104.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;104.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">104.7</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱工具稳健 CI</td>\n<td><code>weakiv</code> / AR 反演</td>\n<td>报告 AR 置信区间作对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度识别</td>\n<td><code>estat overid</code> / <code>iv.sargan</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 值高且工具不全同向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内生性检验</td>\n<td><code>estat endogenous</code>（Durbin-Wu-Hausman）</td>\n<td>拒绝则确需 IV，否则 OLS 更高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OLS vs 2SLS 对比</td>\n<td>并列两列系数</td>\n<td>方向与量级是否合理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Andrews、Stock 与 Sun 的方法论综述，以及对政治学 60 余项 IV 研究的复现评估（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2303.11399\">arXiv 2303.11399</a>）都强调：透明地同时汇报第一阶段与第二阶段诊断，是 IV 研究可信度的底线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内生性使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[X&#x27;\\varepsilon]\\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，OLS 不再一致；它来自遗漏变量、联立性与测量误差三类源头。</li>\n<li>工具变量需同时满足相关性、外生性与排他性；恰好识别时后两者无法用数据检验，只能靠制度论证。</li>\n<li>2SLS 用第一阶段拟合值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 萃取外生变异，必须用专门软件以获得正确标准误。</li>\n<li>弱工具是头号风险：F&gt;10 的旧法则已被取代，双尾 t 检验要可靠需 F 高达 104.7（Lee et al. 2022），实务应改用 Anderson-Rubin 等弱识别稳健推断。</li>\n<li>处理效应异质时 2SLS 估计的是顺从者的 LATE，不同工具对应不同子群；解读必须指明人群（Mogstad-Torgovitsky 2024）。</li>\n<li>过度识别检验提供部分外生性证据但有盲区；可信的报告应并列 OLS/2SLS、第一阶段 F、稳健 CI、过度识别与内生性检验。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内生性与工具变量（2SLS）","id":"内生性与工具变量-2sls"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：内生性从何而来","id":"核心概念-内生性从何而来"},{"level":2,"text":"2SLS 的机制：两次回归拆解相关性","id":"2sls-的机制-两次回归拆解相关性"},{"level":2,"text":"弱工具问题：F>10 已经不够用","id":"弱工具问题-f-10-已经不够用"},{"level":2,"text":"LATE 解读：异质性下 2SLS 估计的到底是什么","id":"late-解读-异质性下-2sls-估计的到底是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"过度识别与诊断检验清单","id":"过度识别与诊断检验清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异方差与自相关及稳健标准误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/assumption-violations/heteroskedasticity-and-autocorrelation"},"next":{"title":"多重共线性与测量误差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/assumption-violations/multicollinearity-and-measurement-error"}}